### ============================================
### 发布引擎模块测试 (vellastra-publish :8088)
### ============================================

### 1. 站点列表
GET http://localhost:8080/publish/sites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. 创建站点
# @name createSite
POST http://localhost:8080/publish/sites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "个人博客站",
  "slug": "blog",
  "repoUrl": "https://github.com/user/blog",
  "buildCommand": "npm run build",
  "outputDir": "dist",
  "domain": "blog.example.com",
  "notifyEmail": "admin@example.com"
}

> {% client.global.set("siteId", response.body.data); %}

### 3. 站点详情
GET http://localhost:8080/publish/sites/{{siteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. 更新站点
PUT http://localhost:8080/publish/sites/{{siteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "个人博客站V2",
  "description": "更新描述",
  "repoUrl": "https://github.com/user/blog",
  "buildCommand": "npm run build",
  "outputDir": "dist",
  "domain": "blog.example.com",
  "notifyEmail": "admin@example.com"
}

### 5. 触发构建
# @name startBuild
POST http://localhost:8080/publish/builds?siteId={{siteId}}&environment=production
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-User-Id: 1

> {% client.global.set("buildId", response.body.data); %}

### 6. 构建记录分页
GET http://localhost:8080/publish/builds?siteId={{siteId}}&status=&current=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. 构建详情
GET http://localhost:8080/publish/builds/{{buildId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. 构建历史
GET http://localhost:8080/publish/builds/history/{{siteId}}?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. 重试构建
POST http://localhost:8080/publish/builds/{{buildId}}/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. 回滚构建
POST http://localhost:8080/publish/builds/{{buildId}}/rollback?targetBuildId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-User-Id: 1

### 11. 删除站点
DELETE http://localhost:8080/publish/sites/{{siteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
